E0201: "Curves" cannot be used as a component name. Names in a ply.yaml are written the way Rust module names are: a lowercase letter first, then lowercase letters, digits or underscores — `pricing`, `db_raw`, `hot_path`. They are Ply's own names for the pieces of your system, not Rust paths, so capitals, dashes, dots and spaces have no meaning here. Found at `components.pricing.components.Curves` in ply.yaml.
